    - id: technology
      markdown: "# Technology & tooling\n\nChoose technology with evidence.\n\n## Selected frameworks and platforms\n\n<!-- sdd:answer technology.1 -->\n| Technology | Version | Purpose | Ring |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| React | 19 | Web frontend | Adopt |\n| Fastify | 5 | Backend & APIs | Adopt |\n| TypeScript | 5.9 | Web frontend | Adopt |\n| Vite | 7 | Web frontend | Adopt |\n| Vitest | 3 | Testing & quality | Adopt |\n| Playwright | 1.5x | Testing & quality | Adopt |\n| Storybook | 10 | Testing & quality | Adopt |\n| ESLint | 9 | Testing & quality | Adopt |\n| PostgreSQL | 8 | Data storage | Adopt |\n| OpenTelemetry | 1.x (stable signals) | Observability | Adopt |\n| Node.js | 24 | Backend & APIs | Adopt |\n| Python | 3.14 | Backend & APIs | Adopt |\n| Docker | Engine latest | Hosting, cloud & VMs | Adopt |\n| Kubernetes | 1.35 | Hosting, cloud & VMs | Adopt |\n| Helm | 4 | Infrastructure as code | Assess |\n| GitHub Actions | Hosted | CI/CD & pipeline | Adopt |\n<!-- sdd:end -->\n\n## Version and support policies\n\n<!-- sdd:answer technology.2 -->\n_Not answered yet._\n<!-- sdd:end -->\n\n## Licenses and restrictions\n\n<!-- sdd:answer technology.3 -->\n_Not answered yet._\n<!-- sdd:end -->\n\n## Alternatives considered\n\n<!-- sdd:answer technology.4 -->\n_Not answered yet._\n<!-- sdd:end -->\n\n## Official and custom references\n\n<!-- sdd:answer technology.5 -->\n_Not answered yet._\n<!-- sdd:end -->\n\n## Development tooling\n\n<!-- sdd:answer technology.6 -->\n_Not answered yet._\n<!-- sdd:end -->\n\n## Adoption rationale\n\n<!-- sdd:answer technology.7 -->\n_Not answered yet._\n<!-- sdd:end -->\n\n## Approved usage and restrictions\n\n<!-- sdd:answer technology.8 -->\n_Not answered yet._\n<!-- sdd:end -->\n"
